Third-party software

This repository vendors its dependencies as git submodules under lib/. Each
keeps its own licence file in its own directory, unaltered, and nothing under
lib/ is relicensed by the notice above. The dependency set and remapping layout
follow the public Uniswap v4 hook starter template (github.com/Uniswap/v4-template,
MIT, copyright 2023 saucepoint), which was used as a starter kit and not cloned.
